` The eight bits FMOV takes for a float, or none when the float has no such form: a sign, an
` exponent of three bits that is not all of the exponent's, and the top four bits of a fraction.
|? (bits /and/ ((1u64 /lshift/ fraction-bits) - 1)) != 0
